<title>USA: FMR group had 7.50 pct ADT Ltd stake.</title>
<headline>FMR group had 7.50 pct ADT Ltd stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it cut its stake ADT Ltd to 10,238,998 common shares or 7.50 percent from 14.85 percent held on February 14.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on ADT in a 13G filing. FMR Corp is the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
